close_reason: "Gate implemented, wired into release:check and CI, 19 behavioural tests passing, and all 103 violations it exposed are fixed"
body: "Parsing is pinned to a typescript@5 alias devDependency because TypeScript 7 removed the stable compiler API: createSourceFile and forEachChild are absent at runtime while still type-checking, and the unstable replacements are either a raw lexer the consumer must drive through template and regex rescanning, or a project API needing a live native language-server session."
